{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">謝賢離世｜為悼念香港資深影視紅星謝賢（四哥）離世，TVB將推出多項特別安排。翡翠台將於本周六（25日）晚上9時30分播映半小時特備節目《永遠瀟灑的四哥 謝賢》，輯錄四哥的經典作品及精彩片段，以懷念這位縱橫影視界超過70年的一代巨星。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"66fe3b04-44ac-4cf2-9c63-920d4ab408e6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026oNTSeiVtIW1784623209.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"66fe3b04-44ac-4cf2-9c63-920d4ab408e6.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">隨後於同日晚上10時20分，翡翠台將特別安排播映四哥的電影代表作《殺出個黃昏》。四哥曾憑此片於2022年榮獲香港電影金像獎最佳男主角，成就其演藝事業的另一重要里程碑。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">此外，TVB Plus 將於8月3日至18日（星期一至六，除賽馬日外）晚上10時30分播映經典劇集《千王之王》，每晚播映兩集。該劇由謝賢、汪明荃、楊群及任達華等主演，是四哥主演的無綫最受歡迎經典劇集之一。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ba380e3c-9329-4496-9477-9e60071b731d.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026QDpiEelqAC1784623215.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ba380e3c-9329-4496-9477-9e60071b731d.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T08:58:15.841525+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}